                r (e.g. after
 9D62   0C3A            '      exiting Win98 to MS-DOS mode); calling INT 33h o
                n it hangs.  A real
 9D62   0C3A            '      driver's handler starts with executable code (mo
                use.com begins with
 9D62   0C3A            '      a JMP, &HEB), never a bare IRET (&HCF) or a 0/de
                ad byte -- so this
